<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italy CCT auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italy CCT auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a fifth tranche of 2.0 trillion lire of seven-year Italian Treasury floating rate certificates (CCTs) paying a first coupon of 3.45 percent.</p>
<p>		   May 1, 2004 CCT		Pvs</p>
<p>    Net Yield	   6.12 pct		6.00 pct</p>
<p>    Gross yield	 7.01 pct		6.87 pct</p>
<p>    Assigned price   99.00		   99.20</p>
<p>    Total bids	  6.645 trln lire</p>
<p>    Assigned	    2.000 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparisons are with a previous auction on May 15.</p>
</text>
